{
    "category": "business",
    "icon": "building-store",
    "name": { "fr": "Stock de boutique", "en": "Shop stock" },
    "summary": {
        "fr": "Tenez le stock de votre boutique : références, codes-barres EAN, prix d'achat et de vente, TVA, quantités, fournisseurs et photos des produits.",
        "en": "Keep your shop's stock in order: SKUs, EAN barcodes, cost and selling prices, VAT, quantities, suppliers and product photos."
    },
    "description": {
        "fr": [
            "Ce modèle s'adresse aux commerçants, artisans et créateurs qui vendent en boutique, sur les marchés ou en ligne et veulent un stock clair. Chaque produit a une référence, un code-barres EAN, une catégorie, un fournisseur, une quantité, un prix d'achat HT, un taux de TVA et un prix de vente TTC.",
            "Ajoutez des photos des produits : la vue galerie affiche la première photo de chaque fiche et permet de parcourir le stock comme un catalogue. Le champ « Stock minimum » sert de repère pour vos réassorts : triez la colonne « Quantité en stock » de la plus petite à la plus grande pour voir ce qui manque.",
            "Astuces : filtrez par fournisseur pour préparer une commande, ou par catégorie pour un comptage partiel, et affichez le total de la colonne « Quantité en stock » pour connaître le nombre de pièces. Lors d'un inventaire, corrigez les quantités directement dans le tableau ; l'historique conserve les valeurs précédentes."
        ],
        "en": [
            "This template is for shopkeepers, craftspeople and makers who sell in a shop, at markets or online and want a clear view of their stock. Each product has a SKU, an EAN barcode, a category, a supplier, a quantity, a cost price excluding tax, a VAT rate and a selling price including tax.",
            "Add product photos: the gallery view shows the first photo of each item, so you can browse your stock like a catalog. The \"Minimum stock\" field is a reference point for restocking: sort the \"Quantity in stock\" column from lowest to highest to see what is running short.",
            "Tips: filter by supplier to prepare an order, or by category for a partial count, and show the total of the \"Quantity in stock\" column to know how many pieces you hold. During a stocktake, correct quantities straight in the table; the history keeps the previous values."
        ]
    },
    "fields": [
        { "key": "name", "type": "text", "name": { "fr": "Produit", "en": "Product" }, "required": true },
        { "key": "sku", "type": "text", "name": { "fr": "Référence", "en": "SKU" } },
        {
            "key": "ean",
            "type": "barcode",
            "name": { "fr": "Code-barres EAN", "en": "EAN barcode" },
            "options": { "format": "ean13" }
        },
        {
            "key": "category",
            "type": "select",
            "name": { "fr": "Catégorie", "en": "Category" },
            "options": {
                "choices": [
                    { "key": "apparel", "label": { "fr": "Prêt-à-porter", "en": "Apparel" }, "color": "blue" },
                    { "key": "accessories", "label": { "fr": "Accessoires", "en": "Accessories" }, "color": "purple" },
                    { "key": "home", "label": { "fr": "Maison et déco", "en": "Home and decor" }, "color": "orange" },
                    { "key": "gourmet", "label": { "fr": "Épicerie fine", "en": "Gourmet food" }, "color": "green" },
                    {
                        "key": "beauty",
                        "label": { "fr": "Beauté et bien-être", "en": "Beauty and wellness" },
                        "color": "pink"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "stationery",
                        "label": { "fr": "Papeterie et loisirs", "en": "Stationery and hobbies" },
                        "color": "teal"
                    },
                    { "key": "other", "label": { "fr": "Autre", "en": "Other" }, "color": "gray" }
                ]
            }
        },
        { "key": "supplier", "type": "text", "name": { "fr": "Fournisseur", "en": "Supplier" } },
        {
            "key": "quantity",
            "type": "number",
            "name": { "fr": "Quantité en stock", "en": "Quantity in stock" },
            "options": { "decimals": 0, "min": "0" }
        },
        {
            "key": "min_stock",
            "type": "number",
            "name": { "fr": "Stock minimum", "en": "Minimum stock" },
            "options": { "decimals": 0, "min": "0" }
        },
        {
            "key": "cost",
            "type": "money",
            "name": { "fr": "Prix d'achat HT", "en": "Cost price (excl. tax)" },
            "options": { "currency": "EUR" }
        },
        {
            "key": "vat",
            "type": "percentage",
            "name": { "fr": "Taux de TVA", "en": "VAT rate" },
            "options": { "decimals": 1 }
        },
        {
            "key": "price",
            "type": "money",
            "name": { "fr": "Prix de vente TTC", "en": "Selling price (incl. tax)" },
            "options": { "currency": "EUR" }
        },
        { "key": "on_sale", "type": "boolean", "name": { "fr": "En vente", "en": "On sale" } },
        { "key": "location", "type": "text", "name": { "fr": "Emplacement", "en": "Storage location" } },
        {
            "key": "photos",
            "type": "photo",
            "name": { "fr": "Photos", "en": "Photos" },
            "options": { "max_files": 3 }
        }
    ],
